---
code: field.name.camel-case
description: Convert delimiter-separated field names to lower camelCase (user_name -> userName)
default-enabled: false
---

# Underscores, hyphens and spaces are treated as word separators.
field.name=groovy:```
    return tool.toCamelCase(it.fieldName(), false, '_'.charAt(0), '-'.charAt(0), ' '.charAt(0))
```
